  "title": "Microwaved Baked Sweet Potatoes",
  "description": "When you&#39;re in a rush on busy weeknights, try &#34;baking&#34; your sweet potatoes in the microwave using this quick and easy recipe.",
  "authors": [
    "Chris Denzer"
  ],
